king material will want the same vocabulary.\n```","ttft_ms":75986,"ttft_stream_ms":3334,"time_to_request_ms":71,"type":"result","duration_ms":450837,"uuid":"0426d3de-2f85-4d19-ab6f-a0c30bc1f689"}
